    "text": "## Description\nThis dataset is a subset of the original data obtained from the LPIS scheme in Slovakia by the Agricultural Payment Agency. (LPIS parts of land blocks 2021) LPIS is an agricultural land identification system. It represents the vector boundaries of agricultural land and carries information about the unique code, acreage, culture/land use, etc., which is used as a reference for farmers' applications, for administrative and cross-checks, on-site checks and also checks using remote sensing methods.\n\n_The field boundaries are valid for the year 2021_\n\n- **Original Data Provider:** [Agricultural Payment Agency](https://data.slovensko.sk/datasety/7998b5ab-83f4-80f4-9ba3-7fa62dd79cd)\n- **Converted by:** Kerner Lab (ASU)\n- **License:** CC0-1.0\n- **Projection:** EPSG:4326\n\n---\n\n## Columns\n\n| Property                  | Data Type |\n| ------------------------- | --------- |\n| id                        | string    |\n| determination_datetime    | datetime  |\n| area                      | float     |\n| municipality              | string    |\n| eligibility_for_subsidies | string    |\n| arable_crop_class_code    | string    |\n| arable_crop_class         | string    |\n| arable_crop_class_icode   | int8      |\n"
  },
